<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Crown Cork &amp; Seal raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Crown Cork &amp; Seal raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Joel Tiss upgraded Crown Cork &amp; Seal Co Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cited the recent share price drop.</p>
<p>-- said in report that 1998 estimates are &quot;finally coming into line&quot; after Wall Street expectations were &quot;way ahead of reality.&quot;</p>
<p>-- trimmed 1997 earnings estimate to $2.65 a share from $3.00 and dropped 1998 to $3.60 from $3.75.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 9/16 to 50-15/16.</p>
</text>
